        "punchline": "The kind twist at the end."
      },
      "note": "beat \"setup\" lays the full meme out but hides the punchline, so the first beat of a two-beat video matches the second exactly. The punchline is the accent line, in the tone colour (butter unless tone says mint or coral).",
