            "$2M"
          ],
          [
            "Also in the story: two more names",
            ""
          ]
        ]
      },
      "note": "rows are [name, value]: the name on the left, the value in a solid chip, butter, mint and lilac in turn. A row with an empty value is a quiet strip of names. Up to four rows."
    },
